2 CONT
2 CONT Katarina Hanna
2 CONT
2 CONT she was married again after her first husband Bror John Murman, died in 1930 
2 CONT
2 CONT she married 1931 captain and count Arvid Fredrik Posse born 1873 an he died 1946
2 CONT
2 CONT Katarina Hanna died 20/7 1965
2 CONT
2 CONT In the same grave in Stockholm is:
2 CONT
2 CONT Murman, Bror John 1930
2 CONT
