2 CONT
2 CONT Rydin, Bo Hjalmar  2003   (Hedvig Eugenie Catharina´s husband)
2 CONT
2 CONT they all burried in the same grave 
2 CONT
2 CONT at Stockholms norra begravningsplats, avd. 1, kv. 13B, nr. 986 
