2 CONT "John lilaauw, editor of the "Tacoma
2 CONT Tidende" and owner of the lilaauw's
2 CONT system, wan in town yesterday.
2 CONT Mr. Blaauw places $25,000 worth of
2 CONT advertising for the Gulden Grain Co.
2 CONT This company has put on the market
2 CONT the hist cereal diink, viz., "Golden
2 CONT Grain Granules," that has ever been
2 CONT tasted by mankind.
2 CONT Wo peopla get into habits of drinking
2 CONT coffee and tea, until we ruin our health.
2 CONT We havo got to change this habit and
2 CONT drink Golden Grain Granules or we
2 CONT shall ruin our kidneys, liver, nerves, etc.
2 CONT G. G. G. tastes like coffee, but it
2 CONT builds your system up, and that is what
2 CONT most of us mortals need, an everyday,
2 CONT natural tonic."
2 CONT
