2 CONT Publikasjon	  Los Angeles, Los Angeles, California, USA
2 CONT Dato	28. mar 1906
2 CONT
2 CONT "GIRLS, HERE'S A CHANCE
2 CONT TO WIN A HAPPY HOME!
2 CONT LONELY MEN AWAIT YOU IN
2 CONT TACOMA
2 CONT Champion Booster Blaauw of Tacoma
2 CONT Wants 9999 Maidens to Make
2 CONT Glad the Hearts of North.
2 CONT em Bachelors
2 CONT There are 9999 lonely men in the state
2 CONT of Washington who want wives. There
2 CONT are just about as many unattached
2 CONT women in Southern California who
2 CONT want Perhaps they do and perhaps they
2 CONT don't. If they don't, there is something
2 CONT wrong with them, says John Blaauw of
2 CONT Tacoma, star "booster" of the Washington
2 CONT delegation.
2 CONT tjMr. Blaauw takes the dearth of shirtwaists
2 CONT in his part of tho country quite
2 CONT seriously, and while not desiring to appear
2 CONT as a wholesale matrimonial agent,
2 CONT he has not lost an opportunity to speak
2 CONT a word on his dearest hobby.
2 CONT "Washington wants girls, girls, girls,"
2 CONT he said. "The state Is full of men who
2 CONT can well afford to keep families, and
2 CONT they are anxious to find wives. We
2 CONT have a good class of men there, too,
2 CONT hard-working and moral. We have not
2 CONT the cafe life that you have here, which
2 CONT MESHES DRAWING
2 CONT AROUND WOMAN"
2 CONT
