1 NAME Simeon Christian Wilhelm /Radich/
2 GIVN Simeon Christian Wilhelm
2 SURN Radich
2 _MARNM Radich
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 15 AUG 1822
2 ADDR
3 CITY Halden
